        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On iPhone, FERB's questions and news reach you while FERB is open and for a short while after you leave it. Once iOS closes it, they wait on your Mac and show the moment you open FERB again. Your Mac never stops for this: what it is doing goes on."
          }
